%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 85cd55c6b0955304c90bc3c8ea81e738, type: 3}
  m_Name: 4aONU
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::FullSceneDialogue
  dialogueLinesInOrder:
  - line: Let's begin. <2> We have been talking about it for a while now, <2> but
      the forecast is now final.
    duration: 7
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 0
    voice: 12
  - line: Within twenty years, <2> we will lack resources to sustain ninety five
      percent of humanity.
    duration: 6
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 0
    voice: 12
  - line: Our goal today is not to make sure everyone is taken care of, <4> this
      will just not work.
    duration: 6
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 0
    voice: 12
  - line: Our goal instead is to make sure the remaining five percent can continue
      to contribute to the cause.
    duration: 6
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0.5
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 0
    voice: 12
  - line: "Those five percent are useful, <2> and that\u2019s everything that matters."
    duration: 6
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 0
    voice: 13
  - line: We will maintain them so they can work and ensure the conformable life
      of ours, <3>but that will be the extent of it.
    duration: 8
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0.5
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 0
    voice: 13
  - line: What about the other eighty percent ?
    duration: 4
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0.5
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 0
    voice: 14
  - line: They are not in the model. <3>Let them starve.
    duration: 5
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0.5
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 0
    voice: 13
  - line: "Wouldn\u2019t that lead to revolts ? <3> Insurrection ?"
    duration: 5
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0.5
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 0
    voice: 12
  - line: "You\u2019re right. We might need a more\u2026 <3>  direct solution."
    duration: 5
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0.5
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 1
    voice: 13
  - line: //END// (x2)
    duration: 2
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0.5
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 1
    voice: 0
